---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Custom Neon Signs | Manchester Sign Group" description="Explore custom neon-style signs for business names, logos and branded interiors with Manchester Sign Group. Delivery throughout the United Kingdom.">
  <main class="inner-page">
    <div class="page-head"><small>NEON-STYLE SIGNAGE</small><h1>NEON <em>SIGNS</em></h1><p>Bring your name, message or brand to life with a custom neon-style sign designed around your idea.</p></div>
    <section class="content-card"><h2>Neon signs for brands and spaces</h2><p>Neon-style signs can be used to display a business name, logo, short message or decorative design. They are often considered for hospitality venues, retail spaces, studios, reception areas and branded interiors. The design can be planned around the text or artwork you want to display and the space available.</p><p>To help us assess your request, share a reference image if you have one, the wording or logo, approximate dimensions and where the sign will be used. We can then discuss the available design and production options.</p></section>
    <section class="content-card"><h2>Before you request a quote</h2><ul><li>Keep the wording and artwork as clear as possible.</li><li>Provide approximate width and height in centimetres.</li><li>Tell us the intended indoor or outdoor location.</li><li>Include your preferred colours and any mounting requirements.</li></ul></section>
    <section class="content-card"><h2>Delivery and warranty</h2><p>Manchester Sign Group is based in Manchester and offers delivery throughout the United Kingdom. Confirm your project details with us before ordering, especially if you need installation or have specific fitting requirements. All products include a one-year warranty.</p></section>
    <div class="page-actions"><a href="/quote/">REQUEST A QUOTE →</a><a class="secondary" href="/services/">VIEW ALL SERVICES →</a></div>
    <nav class="related"><strong>Explore other sign types</strong><a href="/3d-signs/">3D signs</a><a href="/rgb-signs/">RGB 3D signs</a><a href="/flat-signs/">Flat signs</a></nav>
  </main>
</Layout>
<style>
.inner-page{width:min(900px,92%);margin:auto;padding:65px 0 85px}.page-head{max-width:760px;margin-bottom:28px}.page-head small{color:#ff1730;font-size:11px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:3px}.page-head h1{font-size:clamp(42px,8vw,72px);letter-spacing:-3px;line-height:1;margin:10px 0 14px}.page-head h1 em{font-style:normal;color:#ff1730}.page-head p,.content-card p,.content-card li{color:#aaa;line-height:1.75;font-size:15px}.content-card{padding:22px 24px;margin:14px 0;background:#0c0f11;border:1px solid #303437;border-radius:12px}.content-card h2{font-size:21px;margin:0 0 12px}.content-card p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}.content-card ul{padding-left:20px}.content-card li{padding:4px 0}.page-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:22px}.page-actions a{padding:15px 18px;border-radius:8px;background:#ff1730;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-size:12px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.5px}.page-actions .secondary{background:transparent;border:1px solid #444}.related{display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;margin-top:28px;padding-top:22px;border-top:1px solid #303437}.related strong{width:100%;font-size:13px}.related a{color:#ff6677;font-size:13px}@media(max-width:600px){.inner-page{padding:45px 0 65px}.content-card{padding:18px}.content-card h2{font-size:19px}.page-head h1{font-size:46px}}
</style>